(TYP-02: `float` is documented as 64-bit IEEE 754 (LANGUAGE.md:433).
 0.1 + 0.2 is not exactly representable in binary64 and rounds to a
 value strictly greater than the nearest representation of 0.3 — the
 textbook double-rounding fingerprint. Confirms the claim; not a
 discrepancy.
